{"title":"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay B Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Replace <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> below with the number you receive.\n</p><p>Santiago is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> years old. He lives with his older sister, his father, and his grandmother. His older sister is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> years old, his father is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> years old, and the average (mean) of all the four ages is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. How old is Santiago’s grandmother?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The average of all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> ages is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so the total of their ages is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/8/c9868c06ff7f03c0956394b3b1ebd59ba3d9c5d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25 \\times 4 = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Santiago and his older sister have a combined age of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/4/0f415cda52590a9ebab71db39b7caea485ad25ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + 8 = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />, so the total for everyone except the grandmother is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/f/00fef7385308e5904febac37a421ccd6221861b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N + 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" />. This means that the grandmother is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/5/7d53c531225248c4518ad7ad3d7eedf670ad66cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 - (N + 13) = 87 - N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"204\" height=\"20\" /> years old.\n</p><p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_3\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay B Problem 3\">player 3</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/8/fd8c49c8d4baddb6a9f138924a6d354fe354ce8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = 31$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" />. This means that the grandmother is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/1/331a5f68806cd714c8b93da1cccf9f2220a5339b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$87 - 31 = \\boxed{56}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"114\" height=\"25\" /> years old.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC\">2023 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_3\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay B Problem 3\">Relay B Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_C_Problem_1\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay C Problem 1\">Relay C Problem 1</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 